lse,"backdrop_path":"/961SQWKlq6EQKN5lvXLR04YxSkw.jpg","id":31572,"name":"Lupin the 3rd","original_name":"ルパン三世","overview":"Follow the exciting adventures of Arsene Lupin III, the grandson of the world's greatest thief, Arsene Lupin. Together with Daisuke Jigen, Goemon Ishikawa and his love interest Fujiko Mine, he carries out the greatest robberies of all time, all the while evading the control of Inspector Koichi Zenigata.","poster_path":"/khfsxY7EyQsdEHzlnkn42CIjZI.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765],"popularity":66.486,"first_air_date":"1971-10-24","softcore":false,"vote_average":8,"vote_count":136,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mVE1ULmLaYhCkBQPt3JC5xZC6T6.jpg","id":35610,"name":"InuYasha","original_name":"犬夜叉","overview":"Kagome Higurashi is a modern day young girl who lives with her family by the old Higure shrine. Unbeknownst to Kagome, she is the reincarnation of priestess Kikyo and posseses the \"Jewel of Four Souls\" (the Shikon jewel). One ill-fated day, Kagome locates an ancient well near her home and is abruptly transported through the well and into a feudal Japan, inhabited by demons. There, she encounters Inuyasha, son of a powerful demon father and a human mother, who is pinned to a tree by an enchanted arrow.","poster_path":"/rQHTNaynedeKurm0sNOsbAZg2oe.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765],"popularity":43.1834,"first_air_date":"2000-10-16","softcore":false,"vote_average":8.566,"vote_count":2115,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/fo5qwDAVqY7j2jmL350WKjk6kmi.jpg","id":134667,"name":"Reincarnated as a Sword","original_name":"転生したら剣でした","overview":"Reincarnated as a sentient weapon with memories of his past life, but not his name, a magical sword saves a young beastgirl from a life of slavery. Fran, the cat-eared girl, becomes his wielder, and wants only to grow stronger, while the sword wants to know why he is here. Together, the strange duo's journey has only just begun!","poster_path":"/yZ3VZVc7iyF7KtIjERBGEedVXqA.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,35,10765],"popularity":25.6345,"first_air_date":"2022-10-05","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.3,"vote_count":95,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8vzSh6eEiCbAmi5wpXSXX3jKEKP.jpg","id":8880,"name":"Space Cobra","original_name":"スペースコブラ","overview":"Cobra lived an adventurous life until his enemies began to hunt him down. He surgically altered his face and erased his own memory in order to hide from his foes and lead a normal life. Eventually, he regains his memories and re-unites with his old partner Lady Armaroid and his ship Tortuga. Cobra travels the galaxy, fighting the outlaw Pirate Guild, but also fleeing the law-enforcing Milky Way Patrol.","poster_path":"/v7mbZ8zYkm2tMP3WnKgcFN2tNuN.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[10759,16,10765],"popularity":10.0643,"first_air_date":"1982-10-07","softcore":false,"vote_average":8.2,"vote_count":228,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/g3VSNIzadeCmovQBuYIPERclZJm.jpg","id":34065,"name":"Black Cat","original_name":"ブラックキャット","overview":"The bounty hunter Sven is barely scraping by when he crosses paths with the Black Cat (a.k.a. Train Heartnet) and the young bio-weapon Eve. The three new companions will need more than luck to survive when they find themselves sought by both the Chronos Numbers and a Taoist revolutionary group called the Apostles of the Star.","poster_path":"/1GpXrmDmQmRrsXLbMY8y0YaxHLL.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[10759,16,10765],"popularity":13.0347,"first_air_date":"2005-10-07","softcore":false,"vote_average":7,"vote_count":42,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/cYMydFAatb4guDgOzKIeBEonaa4.jpg","id":76134,"name":"Mitsuboshi Colors","original_name":"三ツ星カラーズ","overview":"Residing within Tokyo’s district of Ueno are the Colors, three individuals who protect their city by performing good deeds and aiding their community. Or, at the very least, they pretend to be the city’s defenders. In reality, the Colors are just three young girls who spend their time playing make-believe and exploring the city. The Colors’ activities are facilitated by the grandfatherly Daigorou \"Pops\" Kujiraoka, who uses his store’s inventory of knick-knacks to entertain the rambunctious trio.\n\nNot everyone is a fan of the Colors though. The local policeman Saitou just wants to deal with his regular duties, but he often finds himself the target of the Colors’ attention, having been made the villain in most of their fantasies. But despite his personal feelings, Saitou always finds the time to go along with the three girls’ games. Even though the Colors do not actually defend Ueno, they definitely help brighten everyone’s day.","poster_path":"/uiB412p9JIfTqavtfJ54Izd64TD.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,35],"popularity":10.5255,"first_air_date":"2018-01-07","softcore":false,"vote_average":7,"vote_count":28,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/1qxFtePUVvX0dMMzBEMGhB2Oc7u.jpg","id":36089,"name":"The Legend of the Legendary Heroes","original_name":"伝説の勇者の伝説","overview":"At his emperor's command, Ryner Lute and his long-time comrade Ferris set out on a search for the Heroic Relics. During this journey, Ryner makes a shocking discovery - a deadly curse is spreading across the continent.","poster_path":"/lEwhuJ0mQGFJI4oGGewXfMMnmNy.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765],"popularity":10.7821,"first_air_date":"2010-06-26","softcore":false,"vote_average":8,"vote_count":61,"origin_country":["JP"]}],"total_pages":17,"total_results":324},"similar":{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/prjadMs3yzfqcFgiXEJ70EMFFDL.jpg","genre_ids":[16,35],"id":210511,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"にじよん あにめーしょん